{"seq":3,"slug":"isolation-clustering","title":"隔离森林与聚类方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/classical-methods/isolation-clustering","wordCount":1461,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"隔离森林与聚类方法\">隔离森林与聚类方法</h1><p>前两篇的方法都在努力刻画&quot;正常长什么样&quot;,然后把不符合的判为异常。隔离森林彻底反转了这个思路：它根本不去描述正常，而是直接去&quot;隔离&quot;异常——因为异常少且不同，用随机切分把它孤立出来所需的步数，会明显少于孤立一个淹没在人群里的正常点。这个反直觉的洞见让隔离森林成为 2025 年工业界事实上的默认基线。这一篇讲透隔离森林，再介绍同样不依赖深度学习的聚类视角检测法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-用切分深度衡量异常\">核心概念：用切分深度衡量异常</h2><p>隔离森林（Isolation Forest，iForest）由 Liu 等人在 2008 年提出。它构建许多棵随机二叉树：每次随机选一个特征、在该特征取值范围内随机选一个切分点，把数据一分为二，递归直到每个点被单独隔离。关键观察是——异常点处在稀疏区，往往几刀就被切出来，所以它在树里的路径很短；正常点淹没在密集区，需要很多刀才能孤立，路径很长。</p>\n<p>异常分数由平均路径长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[h(x)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span> 决定。为了让分数与样本量无关，用二叉搜索树的平均路径长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 归一化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x, n) = 2^{-\\frac{E[h(x)]}{c(n)}}, \\quad c(n) = 2H(n-1) - \\frac{2(n-1)}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4607em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2107em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.4842em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0378em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.6408em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line mtight\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.049em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5021em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5378em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是调和数。分数取值在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示路径极短、强烈异常；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\to 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 附近表示正常。</p>\n<p>隔离森林的优势在 2025 年依然突出：它的时间复杂度近似线性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，远优于距离方法的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；对维度诅咒比距离方法稳健得多；几乎无需调参，子采样规模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span> 取 256 是久经考验的默认值。PyOD 的官方 benchmark 中，隔离森林取得了 0.95 量级的 ROC，是综合性价比最高的方法之一。它还有不错的可解释性——切出一个异常用到的特征和切分点本身就是解释，这点呼应了<a href=\"../foundations/challenges-imbalance\">挑战篇</a>强调的可解释性需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隔离思想的演进\">隔离思想的演进</h2><p>隔离森林本身也在持续改进，下表列出几个重要变体：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>改进点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Extended IF</td>\n<td>用斜超平面切分，消除轴对齐偏置</td>\n<td>特征强相关时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deep IF</td>\n<td>用神经网络做随机表示再隔离</td>\n<td>高维复杂数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FuBIF（2025）</td>\n<td>函数式统一框架，可解释</td>\n<td>需要解释的隔离检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2025 年 arXiv 上的 FuBIF（Function Based Isolation Forest）把各种基于隔离的方法统一进一个可解释框架，说明这条技术路线仍在活跃演进。深度隔离森林（Deep IF）则把隔离思想嫁接到神经表示上，是经典方法向<a href=\"../ml-deep-methods/autoencoder-reconstruction\">深度方法</a>过渡的一个有趣样本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[构建多棵随机二叉树]&#10;    B --&gt; C[每棵树随机选特征+随机切分]&#10;    C --&gt; D[记录每点的隔离路径长度]&#10;    D --&gt; E{路径短?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是 路径短| F[处于稀疏区 → 异常]&#10;    E --&gt;|否 路径长| G[淹没在密集区 → 正常]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;归一化分数 s趋近1&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&quot;归一化分数 s趋近0.5&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[构建多棵随机二叉树]\n    B --&gt; C[每棵树随机选特征+随机切分]\n    C --&gt; D[记录每点的隔离路径长度]\n    D --&gt; E{路径短?}\n    E --&gt;|是 路径短| F[处于稀疏区 → 异常]\n    E --&gt;|否 路径长| G[淹没在密集区 → 正常]\n    F --&gt; H[\"归一化分数 s趋近1\"]\n    G --&gt; I[\"归一化分数 s趋近0.5\"]</pre><h2 id=\"聚类视角的异常检测\">聚类视角的异常检测</h2><p>另一条经典路线借用聚类工具：先把数据聚成簇，凡是不属于任何稠密簇、或属于过小簇的点就是异常。它和聚类分析共用同一套算法，因此可以直接参考<a href=\"../cluster-analysis/clustering-algorithms\">聚类分析</a>那个 hub 的细节，这里只谈它在异常检测里的用法。</p>\n<p>基于密度的 DBSCAN 是天然的选择：它的&quot;噪声点&quot;（不属于任何簇的点）定义和异常高度吻合。DBSCAN 用邻域半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 和最小点数 <code>minPts</code> 定义稠密区，无法归入任何稠密区的点直接标为噪声/异常。它的好处是不用预设簇数、能发现任意形状的簇；坏处是对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 敏感，且在密度不均时表现不稳——这正是 LOF 当年要解决的同一个问题。</p>\n<p>基于划分的 k-means 也能用：先聚类，再把离最近簇中心距离过大的点判为异常。它简单快速，但要预设簇数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，且假设簇是球形，对非球形数据不友好。CBLOF（在<a href=\"distance-density\">距离密度篇</a>提过）正是 k-means 思想与密度分数的结合，它根据点所属簇的大小和到大簇的距离综合打分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隔离森林-vs-聚类法-怎么选\">隔离森林 vs 聚类法：怎么选</h2><p>两条路线的取舍可以归纳如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>隔离森林</th>\n<th>聚类法（DBSCAN/k-means）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否需预设簇数</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>k-means 需要，DBSCAN 不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>DBSCAN 约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，k-means 线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高维稳健性</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>较差（依赖距离）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常分数</td>\n<td>连续、有归一化语义</td>\n<td>多为硬判定或到簇心距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个务实的经验：如果只想要一个强基线、又不想调参，直接上隔离森林；如果数据本身有清晰的簇结构、且你也关心簇的划分，那么 DBSCAN 这类聚类法能一举两得。两者也常被一起放进集成，让<a href=\"../practice/evaluation-metrics\">评估指标</a>来裁决哪个在你的数据上更好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>隔离森林反转了&quot;刻画正常&quot;的思路，转而主动隔离异常——异常因稀疏而路径短，分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x,n)=2^{-E[h(x)]/c(n)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)]</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越接近 1 越异常。</li>\n<li>隔离森林近线性复杂度、抗维度诅咒、几乎免调参（子采样 256 是默认），是 2025 年工业界的事实默认基线，并有 Extended IF、Deep IF、FuBIF 等持续演进的变体。</li>\n<li>聚类视角把&quot;不属于任何稠密簇的点&quot;判为异常，DBSCAN 的噪声点定义与异常天然吻合，k-means 用到簇心距离打分，可复用聚类分析 hub 的工具。</li>\n<li>选型上：要省心强基线用隔离森林，数据有清晰簇结构且关心簇划分用聚类法，二者也可集成后由评估指标裁决。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"隔离森林与聚类方法","id":"隔离森林与聚类方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：用切分深度衡量异常","id":"核心概念-用切分深度衡量异常"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离思想的演进","id":"隔离思想的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"聚类视角的异常检测","id":"聚类视角的异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离森林 vs 聚类法：怎么选","id":"隔离森林-vs-聚类法-怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"距离与密度方法（kNN/LOF）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/classical-methods/distance-density"},"next":{"title":"单类支持向量机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/anomaly-detection/ml-deep-methods/one-class-svm"}}